# Linux patch series for mpv, applied after series.common to the shared
# v0.41.0 pin. build.sh applies this series on every run, so a line added here
# starts applying without touching the driver.
# Every group but android: a MediaCodec that starts failing mid-stream rarely
# recovers, and waiting out its error burst only delays the software fallback.
0025-vd-lavc-recover-hwdec-after-decode-error-burst.patch
